  <h2>Examples</h2>
  <p>The rotation for the reference frame can be found in two steps:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Place the vehicle with front facing east(red arrow) and with left side facing north(green arrow)</li>
    <li>now: <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Rotation" target="_blank">rotation</a> refFrame = <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ZERO_ROTATION" target="_blank">ZERO_ROTATION</a> / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetRootRotation" target="_blank">llGetRootRotation</a>();</li>
